        "title": "1. Using Aggregate Function in WHERE Clause",
        "description": "Attempting to filter on aggregate inside WHERE.",
        "badSnippet": "SELECT department_id, COUNT(*) FROM employees WHERE COUNT(*) > 2 GROUP BY department_id;",
